                                "sense_id": "d7c79c49-17df-3418-b8e2-e4dd95fae18f",
                                "text": "[A]n English traveller […] says that \"he raises his feathers on his head in the form of a crest; he is mixed black and white; the tail distinguished by four cinereous parallel stripes; and he is an undescript bird, not noticed by Linnæus.\""
                            },
